    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1455">

                <pb facs="0949" n="833" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg833"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 612.002/90.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Spanish Ambassador to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Spanish Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-12-04">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 4, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: The Spanish Minister in
                    Mexico telegraphs me that railway communication between Veracruz and the capital
                    having been cut by order of General Carranza, grave fears are entertained by
                    several foreign importers for the safe arrival to the capital of a large
                    consignment of merchandise which is now in transit.</p>
                <p>These goods are valued at 10,000,000 pesos, and they belong half of them to
                    Spanish firms and the other half to English and French importers, and most of
                    them originate from this country.</p>
                <p>I venture to request, in order to prevent the loss of this valuable merchandise,
                    that you employ your good offices with General Carranza in order to obtain a
                    guarantee for its safe arrival at the capital.</p>
                <p>Believe me [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Juan Riaño</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
